      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a53109fa7e3bd02f1023fb1|full_name}: I know it's an old post and I agree, but using override gestures sucks. You never know when you can randomly pull a gun in front of someone's face, and it's especially not recommended if the item is supposed to activate specific sounds. Besides, reuploading the same avatar is kind of a bad option for VRChat too, it only takes more resources from their servers than it would in case with inventories and props, unless everyone starts using them, which I could see coming, since it sounds like a good thing to have.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
